<h2 class="doc-h2">Pattern</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>inputmode</code> and <code>pattern</code> bring the numeric keypad up on a phone and
    reject a letter before a request exists. Both are attributes, and both are the platform's.
</p>
